member.example:
Using following code to detect special bound is intersects with SizeGrip bound.

public bool IntersectsWithSizeGripBound(Rectangle bounds)
{
    return this.GetSizeGripBounds.IntersectsWith(bounds);
}

Using following code to detect special bound is intersects with SizeGrip region.

public bool IntersectsWithSizeGripRegion(Rectangle bounds)
{
    using (Region region = this.GetSizeGripRegion())
    {
        return region.IsVisible(bounds);
    }
}

