member.remarks:
User can store special info in , and when  event fired, user can
get back the data in the event arguments.
for example, user can store the link address in , when in  event,
user can recall the info by following code:

private void LinkLabel_LinkClicked(object sender, LinkLabelLinkClickedEventArgs e)
{
    ((LinkLabel)sender).LinkVisited = false;

    string linkAddress = e.LinkData as string;
    if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(linkAddress))
    {
        // Special method to open link.
        System.Diagnostics.Process.Start(linkAddress);
    }
}

