member.remarks:
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! NOTE !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
 If you wanna get a specified ListItem to get its Y COORDINATE or its HEIGHT internally when data-binding, please ALWAYS use this internal 
 method to instead of the indexer. 

 The most important reason is that if you use the indexer internally to get the specified ListItem then do these two things 
 when data binding, it may cause new ListItem cloned, so the performance will be bad when the number of the cloned 
 ListItem is huge.  Furthermore, if you just wanna get its Y COORDINATE or its HEIGHT internally without what this ListItem instance is created
 in this situation, there is one more effective way as following :

 Here are my suggestion which may help you to do these two things when data binding:

 1> If you want to get the HEIGHT of ListItem when data binding, please use the following codes:
    ==============================================================
      ListItem item = items.GetListItem(i);
      ...
      int itemHeight = -1;   
      List(int) itemHeights  = listData.BindingData.ItemHeightCollection;
      itemHeight = itemHeights[i];
    ==============================================================

 2> If you want to get the Y COORDINATE of ListItem when data binding, please use the following codes:
    ==============================================================
      ListItem item = items.GetListItem(i);
      ...       
      int itemYCoordinate = -1;
      List(int) itemYCoordinates  = listData.BindingData.ItemYCoordinates;
      itemYCoordinate = itemYCoordinates[i];
    =============================== ===============================
                                                                                                             --- Aaron commented on 2007-02-06
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! NOTE !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

