Modify by Alen Yin, 20130802 Project Database:InputMan Win V7.0, Bug RecordID: 335
Bug Real Reason: When switch the field from the one which contains large size DropDown to small size DropDown, the NoFocusListBoxView.LogicalSize is calculate use the old large size. So it will cause this listBoxView can do HScroll.
Related code is in:FieldDropDownAssistant.Holder_Opening(object sender, System.ComponentModel.CancelEventArgs e): this.ListBoxView.ItemSize = new Size(this.ListBoxView.Width, itemMaxSize.Height);

